# Build context of apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (docs/ci-fast-deploys/PLAN-2026-09-29.md).
#
# An allow-list: only what the two images are built from goes to the builder. Everything else stays out — docs/,
# output/, outputs/, obsidian-vault/, apps/factory, services/ — and so does every .env: on a developer machine the root
# .env holds production credentials, and the images are public.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!turbo.json
!patches/
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!packages/
# The one file outside the workspaces that the web imports (the /design-system catalogue shows VT.1's fixtures).
!docs/fixtures/vt1/fixtures.ts

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
apps/api/.release-sha
